        <fields>
            <name>Reminder</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reminder - You now have access to update most fields on accounts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;&quot;&gt;Team, we heard it loud and clear that you wanted more control over account information without needing to file tickets. To support this, we have granted you access to edit most fields on your accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;&quot;&gt;What to Expect:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;You can update most account fields in Salesforce.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Any field that you are not allowed to access is locked down. Some examples are TDLINX ID, MSA ID, parent account, and account owner.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;The data management request feature will be updated this week to remove the selections for the newly updated access that you have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;&quot;&gt;You can still use the data management request for the following issues:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Parent account updates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Mergers and acquisitions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Missing data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Retail Store Group updates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Go6C58TvFZrX1-kV-25Ezu-umLwWuLwuQE_hEgKgQ6k/edit?usp=sharing&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Here is the SOP for making those requests.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
